  "body": "A tool can't store a part number, vendor, coating, helix or free-text notes.\n\n**Where:** `ToolDto` (`crates/app/src/project/file.rs:292`) has no free-text or vendor fields.\n\n**Effect:** tool libraries built from catalogs have to cram the part number, coating and other facts into the tool's name, e.g. `<vendor> <part#> 1/4\" 4FL flat AlTiN LOC 3/4 OAL 2-1/2`. They can't be searched, sorted or shown in a setup sheet's tool list. Reordering a tool means reading the name.\n\n**Fix:** optional fields `part_number`, `vendor`, `coating`, `helix_deg` and `notes` on the tool, as an additive key so old files load unchanged. Show them in the tool editor and on the setup sheet's tool list, and add them to MCP.\n\nEffort: medium (data only, no geometry).\n\n**Done means:** the fields round-trip through `.camproj` and `.camtools`, show on the setup sheet, and are editable via UI and MCP; pinned.\n",
  "closed_by": null,
